---@field created_on? string|distilled.Null
---@field custom_page_html? string|distilled.Null Only available for the Waiting Room Advanced subscription. This is a template html file that will be rendered at the edge. If no custom_page_html is provided, the default waiting room will be used. The template is based on mustache ( https://mustache.github.io/ ). There are several variables that are evaluated by the Cloudflare edge:
---@field default_template_language? cloudflare.waiting_rooms.GetResponseDefaultTemplateLanguage|distilled.Null The language of the default page template. If no default_template_language is provided, then `en-US` (English) will be used.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null A note that you can use to add more details about the waiting room.
---@field disable_session_renewal? boolean|distilled.Null Only available for the Waiting Room Advanced subscription. Disables automatic renewal of session cookies. If `true`, an accepted user will have session_duration minutes to browse the site. After that, they will have to go through the waiting room again. If `false`, a user's session cookie will be automatically renewed on every request.
---@field enabled_origin_commands? cloudflare.waiting_rooms.GetResponseEnabledOriginCommandsList|distilled.Null A list of enabled origin commands.
---@field host? string|distilled.Null The host name to which the waiting room will be applied (no wildcards). Please do not include the scheme (http:// or https://). The host and path combination must be unique.
